", "dir": "caution", "score": -20, "why": "A daily bottoming setup did fire (swing low in, momentum turned up), but it's LATE \u2014 price is already extended above the cycle low (formed ~23 day(s) ago @ 14.51) and overbought (daily RSI 69, 3-day 78 & weekly 78). A momentum cross is a LAGGING confirmation: after a vertical run it only triggers once the move is mature, so the bottoming entry has already passed. This is a chase, not a fresh buy. Last cycle was left-translated (topped early) \u2014 a bearish structural tell.", "next": "Don't initiate here. Wait for a pullback toward the 10-day average \u2014 or the next daily-cycle low to set up \u2014 for a lower-risk entry; hold if you're already long.", "weekly_ok": false, "regime": "neutral", "regime_label": "MIXED", "regime_why": "weekly momentum positive; last cycle left-translated (topped early)", "regime_score": 0.5, "regime_line": "Bigger picture: MIXED \u2014 weekly momentum positive; last cycle left-translated (topped early) (investor cycle week 13 \u00b7 daily cycle day 57).", "summary_line": "Short-term (daily): nearing a high. Bigger picture (no clear trend): mixed.", "synthesis_line": "", "synthesis_line_zh": "", "points": ["Bigger picture is mixed (no clear trend for a daily long)", "Swing low printed (buyers rejected the low)", "Back above the 10-day average, and it's turning up", "Prior cycle topped early (a tiring-trend hint)"], "entry": {"tag": "DON'T CHASE", "tag_zh": "\u52ff\u8ffd\u9ad8", "urgency": "caution", "text": "You missed the bottoming entry \u2014 the low already formed and price is now extended (overbought (daily RSI 69, 3-day 78 & weekly 78)). Don't chase; wait for a pullback to the 10-day average or the next cycle low. Hold if already long.", "text_zh": "\u5df2\u9519\u8fc7\u7b51\u5e95\u5165\u573a\u2014\u2014\u4f4e\u70b9\u5df2\u7ecf\u5f62\u6210\uff0c\u76ee\u524d\u4ef7\u683c\u5df2\u62c9\u4f38\uff08\u5df2\u8d85\u4e70\uff08\u65e5\u7ebf RSI 69\u30013 \u65e5 78 \u4e0e\u5468\u7ebf 78\uff09\uf